{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37638","headline":"回銮 · 郑谷","name":"回銮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妖星沈雨露，和气满京关。\n上将忠勳立，明君法驾还。\n顺风调雅乐，夹道序羣班。\n香泛传宣里，尘清指顾间。\n楼台新紫气，云物旧黄山。\n晓渭行朝肃，秋郊旷望闲。\n庙灵安国步，日角动天颜。\n浩浩昇平曲，流歌彻百蛮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}